  "moments": [
    {
      "id": "tres-de-entrada",
      "title": {
        "es": "Tres victorias de entrada",
        "en": "Three wins to start"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Botvinnik ganó las tres primeras partidas, dos de ellas con la Caro-Kann, una defensa para la que Smyslov no estaba preparado. Después jugó con más cautela para cuidar la ventaja.",
        "en": "Botvinnik won the first three games, two of them with the Caro-Kann, a defence Smyslov was not prepared for. After that he played more cautiously to protect the lead."
      },
      "round": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "smyslov-no-se-rinde",
      "title": {
        "es": "Smyslov no se rinde",
        "en": "Smyslov fights on"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Smyslov ganó las partidas 5, 11, 15, 19 y 22, pero nunca logró alcanzar a Botvinnik, que siempre volvió a sacar distancia.",
        "en": "Smyslov won games 5, 11, 15, 19 and 22, but he never caught Botvinnik, who always pulled ahead again."
      },
      "round": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "revancha-cumplida",
      "title": {
        "es": "Revancha cumplida",
        "en": "Rematch accomplished"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Con unas tablas en la partida 23, Botvinnik llegó a 12½ puntos y volvió a ser campeón del mundo.",
        "en": "With a draw in game 23, Botvinnik reached 12½ points and was world champion once more."
      },
      "round": 23
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "El premio fijado para el ganador era de 5000 rublos.",
        "en": "The prize fund was set at 5,000 roubles for the winner."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia: World Chess Championship 1958",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Chess_Championship_1958"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "Smyslov contó después que su salud sufrió durante la revancha, porque enfermó de neumonía, pero reconoció que Botvinnik se había preparado a fondo.",
        "en": "Smyslov later said his health suffered during the rematch, as he came down with pneumonia, but he acknowledged that Botvinnik had prepared very thoroughly."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia: Vasily Smyslov",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vasily_Smyslov"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "Sumando sus tres matches por el título, Smyslov ganó 18 partidas, Botvinnik 17 y hubo 34 tablas; aun así, Smyslov fue campeón solo un año.",
        "en": "Across their three title matches, Smyslov won 18 games, Botvinnik 17, and 34 were drawn; even so, Smyslov was champion for only one year."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia: Vasily Smyslov",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vasily_Smyslov"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "El regreso de Botvinnik se vio como un símbolo de los ideales de la llamada edad de oro del ajedrez soviético.",
        "en": "Botvinnik's comeback was seen as emblematic of the ideals of the so-called golden age of Soviet chess."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia: World Chess Championship 1958",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Chess_Championship_1958"
      }
    }
  ],
